OL,3,GNEWSABid to restore rare Atlantic
OL,4,Arainforest secures #6m lottery grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost #6m has been given to a
OL,7,Ffive-year project set up to restore
OL,8,FScotland's rare rainforest.
OL,10,FThe award from the National Lottery
OL,11,FHeritage Fund will support the creation
OL,12,Fof three hubs to be located in
OL,13,FTorridon, Morvern and mid-Argyll.
OL,15,FThrough the Our Rainforest Futures
OL,16,Fproject local people will be given
OL,17,Ftraining and work opportunities around
OL,18,Fhabitat restoration, deer management
OL,19,Fand the removal of invasive species.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
